{"4542320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Petro Hunter", "steam_appid": 4542320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542320/extras/8be5f968006200ae0266bda65e5a651e.avif?t=1776056172\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Isle of Man TT reborn in the apocalypse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this world, speed alone is not enough to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Hunter, defeat the monstrous Petro, and use its blood as fuel to push beyond your limits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Race, Tune, Flip, and Fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just a racing game — it’s a bike adventure with story and action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Feel the rush of stunt action at your fingertips!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip through the air, slam down with your wheels, and unleash a hail of bullets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull off daring stunts to hunt down Petros and set your speed on fire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Chase, Escape, Battle! The action never stops!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through maps packed with various hills and Petros</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear missions and objectives to move to the next stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Collect unique characters and build your ultimate bike!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character is unique with its own speed, weapon, and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine parts to customize your very own bike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed is just the basics. Only those who survive can truly call themselves Hunters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The bike action that will set your heart on fire starts now!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542320/extras/8be5f968006200ae0266bda65e5a651e.avif?t=1776056172\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Isle of Man TT reborn in the apocalypse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this world, speed alone is not enough to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Hunter, defeat the monstrous Petro, and use its blood as fuel to push beyond your limits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Race, Tune, Flip, and Fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just a racing game — it’s a bike adventure with story and action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Feel the rush of stunt action at your fingertips!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip through the air, slam down with your wheels, and unleash a hail of bullets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull off daring stunts to hunt down Petros and set your speed on fire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Chase, Escape, Battle! The action never stops!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through maps packed with various hills and Petros</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear missions and objectives to move to the next stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ># Collect unique characters and build your ultimate bike!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character is unique with its own speed, weapon, and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine parts to customize your very own bike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed